      "html": "\n\n            <!-- BLOCK: Impact stats - make a difference -->\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"mobile-pad\" style=\"padding:0 32px 34px 32px;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:Georgia,Cambria,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-size:36px;line-height:39px;font-weight:bold;color:#363635;\">Make a difference</h2>\n                <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.005em;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4d4a46;\">Every pound invested is connected to real projects. We report on what is being funded, how projects are progressing and what your investment helps make possible.</p>\n                <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td class=\"feature-cell\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;padding:0 12px 18px 0;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-top:3px solid #363635;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0 0 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 3px 0;font-family:Georgia,Cambria,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-size:34px;line-height:36px;font-weight:bold;color:#363635;\">65</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.005em;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#4d4a46;\">Projects financed so far</p></td></tr></table></td>\n                    <td class=\"feature-cell\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;padding:0 0 18px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-top:3px solid #363635;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0 0 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 3px 0;font-family:Georgia,Cambria,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-size:34px;line-height:36px;font-weight:bold;color:#363635;\">£9.6m</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.005em;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#4d4a46;\">Spent on projects so far</p></td></tr></table></td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <a href=\"https://www.abundanceinvestment.com/make-a-positive-difference\" class=\"cta-link\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.005em;font-size:15px;line-height:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#c1658b;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid #f27fae;border-radius:999px;\">Learn more</a>\n              </td>\n            </tr>"
